# Halfway 🚀

[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)
[![Expo](https://img.shields.io/badge/Expo-54-orange)](https://expo.dev/)

## About

Halfway is an **Expo‑powered cross‑platform** application that showcases location‑based services, Google Places integration, and real‑time user interactions. It runs on Android, iOS, and the web.

